  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Beyond Compliance Consortium &#x2014; Centre on Armed Groups contribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Centre on Armed Groups is a partner in the Beyond Compliance Consortium, a research programme building evidence on promoting restraint by armed actors. The programme is led by the University of York and funded by the UK Foreign, Commonwealth and Development Office. The Centre&apos;s contribution comprises research on armed group behaviour and engagement, and dialogue and advisory work informed by that research, delivered alongside academic and civil society partners in the consortium.</narrative>
  </description>
